{
  "tutorial": {
    "id": 4270,
    "version": 1,
    "type": "course",
    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Making Decisions",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn to write smart programs that  adapt to different situations.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17184,
        "title": "Conditionals",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Smart games use <strong>booleans</strong> to make decisions on whether to <em>run</em> lines of code or to <em>skip</em> them.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145475,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can we write game code that adapts to different situations? By using the <strong>if statement</strong>.</p><p>We code the <code>if</code> keyword for an if statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145476,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The if statement <em>runs code</em> only if the boolean it's relying on is <code>true</code>. It's like saying, <em>if</em> something is true, <em>then</em> do this.</p><p><code>\"Player spawned!\"</code> will display in the console if we set the boolean value to <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145477,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>But what if we want to <em>skip</em> code? We use <code>false</code> instead.</p><p>By setting the value to <code>false</code>, we'll avoid displaying <code>\"Player spawned!\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145478,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Values like <code>true</code> are called <strong>conditions</strong>. Statements relying on conditions are called <strong>conditionals</strong>.</p><p>Conditions <em>decide</em> if the code runs or gets skipped. They come in between parentheses.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;condition&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the keyword for an if statement?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145480,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3 2 1 GO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3 2 1 GO</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing because the code between the braces gets skipped</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3 2 1 GO</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145481,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy defeated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nothing because the code between the braces gets skipped</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Enemy defeated</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nothing because the code between the braces gets skipped.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145482,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are the values that decide whether a code block runs or not?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Conditions</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Strings</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick Conditions.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assemble the if statement that displays the console.log.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>if</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>true</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145484,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code <code>true</code> to run the code block.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145485,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code a boolean value that skips the display statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Opened inventory&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145486,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Run the display in the console.log by adding <code>(true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"9\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>(true)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17185,
        "title": "True and False Conditionals",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> statements don't decide on skipping or running the <em>entire</em> game code. They only make decisions about a <em>piece of code</em>.</p><p>This piece of code is called a <strong>code block</strong>. We write it between curly braces <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player entered the level!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code>, followed by <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A code block can be more than a one-liner. We can add as many lines as we want.</p><p>Use <code>console.log()</code> to add one more line at the beginning.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemy...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code>, followed by <code>\"Spawning enemy...\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145489,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instead of using the boolean <code>true</code>, we can save it in a variable and use that as a condition.</p><p>Create the variable <code>gameStarted</code> and set it to <code>true</code>. Then, use <code>gameStarted</code> as a condition for the if statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameStarted = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameStarted) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>gameStarted</code>, followed by <code>true</code>, and finally <code>gameStarted</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145490,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Using a variable set to <code>false</code> allows us to <em>skip</em> the code block.</p><p>Set <code>gameStarted</code> to <code>false</code> to avoid printing <code>Game start!</code> in the output.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameStarted = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameStarted) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145491,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we call the code between the curly braces <code>{}</code> of an if statement?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Code block</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">If statement</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Code block.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the maximum number of lines that a code block can have?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">As many as we want</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">One</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">As many as we want.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145493,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Door unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Door unlocked</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing, the code doesn't run since <code>hasKey</code> is not a boolean</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Door unlocked</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145494,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nothing because the code between curly braces gets skipped</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game paused</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nothing because the code between curly braces gets skipped.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145495,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the display statement between curly braces to create the if statement's code block.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level complete!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code> followed by <code>console.log</code> and then <code>\"Level complete!\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145496,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a second code snippet to expand the code block.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New quest started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console.log</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>\"Collect 3 coins\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145497,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make the code block run by assigning a value to the variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canRespawn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (canRespawn) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawning player...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145498,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skip the display statement by setting <code>hasEnoughCoins</code> to <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasEnoughCoins = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasEnoughCoins) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Item purchased&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}